1
00:00:02,136 --> 00:00:04,666
WOLOWITZ:
So, how does this game work?

2
00:00:04,672 --> 00:00:06,442
(Howard:)I just throw it,
like a real ball?

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,840
(Leonard:)Yeah, just nice and easy,
right over the plate.

4
00:00:08,843 --> 00:00:10,713
(Howard:)All right.

5
00:00:10,711 --> 00:00:13,311
(Man in Crowd:)You suck, Wolowitz!

6
00:00:13,314 --> 00:00:15,114
(Howard:)What's that about?

7
00:00:15,116 --> 00:00:16,346
(Raj:)I'm heckling you.

8
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,820
(Raj:)It's a beloved part
of baseball.

9
00:00:17,818 --> 00:00:19,618
SHELDON:
He's right.

10
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,120
(Sheldon:)And given that you're
probably still waiting

11
00:00:21,122 --> 00:00:22,992
(Sheldon:)to be picked for a game that
was played in fifth grade,

12
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:24,920
(Sheldon:)I'm sure you do suck.

13
00:00:26,127 --> 00:00:27,497
(Penny:)Hi. What's going on?

14
00:00:27,495 --> 00:00:28,625
(Raj:)Baseball.

15
00:00:28,629 --> 00:00:30,559
(Penny:)Okay, this is not
what I meant when I said

16
00:00:30,564 --> 00:00:31,894
(Penny:)go outside and play.

17
00:00:31,899 --> 00:00:33,829
(Leonard:)He's practicing.

18
00:00:33,834 --> 00:00:34,734
(Penny:)For what?

19
00:00:34,735 --> 00:00:37,235
(Howard:)The Angels wanted an astronaut

20
00:00:37,238 --> 00:00:38,668
(Howard:)to throw out the first pitch,

21
00:00:38,672 --> 00:00:40,672
(Howard:)so guess who they called?

22
00:00:40,674 --> 00:00:42,074
What, you? Really?!

23
00:00:42,076 --> 00:00:45,476
(Howard:)Well, a lot of people who
weren't available, but then me!

24
00:00:46,647 --> 00:00:47,677
That's so cool!

25
00:00:47,681 --> 00:00:49,011
(Penny:)Congratulations.

26
00:00:49,016 --> 00:00:51,086
(Penny:)I guess that makes you
the athlete of the group.

27
00:00:51,085 --> 00:00:53,055
Well, not just him!

28
00:00:53,054 --> 00:00:55,524
(Sheldon:)May I remind you that you're
talking to the seeker, beater,

29
00:00:55,523 --> 00:00:57,693
(Sheldon:)chaser and water boy

30
00:00:57,691 --> 00:01:00,761
(Sheldon:)of the third place
Griffith Park Quidditch team.

31
00:01:00,761 --> 00:01:02,191
(Penny:)I know.

32
00:01:02,196 --> 00:01:03,766
(Penny:)Watching your boyfriend
run around with a broomstick

33
00:01:03,764 --> 00:01:06,094
(Penny:)between his legs
isn't something you forget.

34
00:01:07,435 --> 00:01:08,705
(Leonard:)C'mon now,
throw one.

35
00:01:08,702 --> 00:01:10,772
(Howard:)All right,
here we go.

36
00:01:10,771 --> 00:01:13,241
You look like a jackass!

37
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:15,240
Cut it out!
You're hurting my feelings!

38
00:01:15,242 --> 00:01:18,212
(Leonard:)Now you know why
we're not outside.

